{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 51897, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 40810, "uid": 42813, "type": 4, "title": "热知识合集", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1598520353, "updated_at": 1640957833, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1650285659, "last_at": 1660476395, "comment_count": 20, "status": 1, "summary": "以下内容仅针对国际服。1.一般判断buff能不能叠加看图标即可，图标不同就能叠。目前唯一的例外是TS强化与TS强化Ⅱ、SS强化与SS强化Ⅱ、Skill强化与Skill强化Ⅱ，为了让区分更明显通常在攻略", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 26, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 34406, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 2, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 51897, "content": "<p>以下内容仅针对国际服。<br><br>1. 一般判断buff能不能叠加看图标即可，图标不同就能叠。目前唯一的例外是TS强化与TS强化<span><span>Ⅱ、<span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">SS强化与SS强化</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">Ⅱ、Skill<span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">强化与Skill强化</span><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; list-style: none;\">Ⅱ，为了让区分更明显通常在攻略中为前者添加符号</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span>Ⅰ。这三对buff，图标相同，但是名称不同，实际可叠加。</span></span></span></span><br><br>2. buff不可叠加时会触发覆盖。覆盖时根据来源存在优先度的高低：DS＞SS＞TS，低级不可覆盖高级，同级时后来的buff覆盖先来的buff。Leaderbuff永远生效。<br><br>3. 加速主要可以分为两类，木莫娜、海王星的时钟图标加速（充能速度提升）与嫦娥的箭头图标加速（充能量提升）。反直觉的，<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">这两类效果为加算</span>。不同之处是，箭头加速可以buff自动攻击和受击获得的充能量，时钟加速不行。除此以外，还有技能条瞬补、SS-2s等其他提高技能释放频率的手段，但通常不称其为加速。注意有些攻略中会出现一个词叫拉条，很容易引起歧义，准确的，可分为技能条瞬补与DS条瞬补。<br><br>4. 在都设置了技能预约的情况下，假设五个人技能CD都转好了，释放技能的顺序为从左到右依次释放，这在WB中也适用。另外所有设置了技能预约的角色行动完才轮到没有设置技能预约的角色。<br><br>5. 角色的转圈速度是一个隐藏属性。无加速情况下通常刀转完一圈需要15s左右，辅助需要12s左右，其他没有测试，不过巴托里是12s左右。<br><br>6. <span style=\"\">暴击公式：</span></p><p><span style=\"\">（面板暴击×0.01）×（0.1×进化星级）+buff=实际暴击率【5-6星】</span></p><p><span style=\"\">（面板暴击×0.01）+buff=实际暴击率【1-4星】</span></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; 来源：<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/75232.html\" style=\"\">暴击机制科普_天命之子wiki_destinychild国际服|Gamekee游戏攻略百科</a></p><p><br>7. 待测：受击时获得技能充能量与自动攻击时获得技能充能量。<br><br>8. 结合以上一部分可以假设buff覆盖率≈持续时间*命中率/冷却时间；冷却时间=cd/（1+加速幅度）+ct；不考虑受击与自动攻击时cd取转圈时间；ct为翻面时间，TS时取0，SS时取对应值。</p><p><br>9. 自动攻击频率随着双方人数改变而改变，五对一（RAID）时我方约12S自动攻击一次；五对五待测。<span><span>自动攻击有如下特性：①第一下自动攻击的发起者规律待测。②自动攻击必定攻击上一次敌方的自动攻击发起者。由此<span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">WB中敌方boss的自动攻击可以打到我方后排，但自动攻击无法越过挑衅。</span></span>③WB中即将轮到一个天子自动攻击时，如果这个天子刚好使用了TS或者SS，那么本该出现的自动攻击就不会发生。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">10. 一回合这个概念是对个人的，而不是对全队的。不考虑石化等特殊情况，当一个角色打出一次自动攻击，视为一回合过去。也就是说木莫娜和嫦娥的两回合加速的时间长短是不稳定的。</span></span></p><p><br>11. 估计RAID、竞技场中DS总值为3000，每次自动攻击获得50点，TS获得200点，SS获得300点。WB的情况待测。满3000点后可释放DS，释放DS之后点数清0。鲜花（DS）、光双刃（SS）等天子可以通过某些技能直接获得点数，也就是DS条瞬补。</p><p><br>12. 根据冷却时间与伤害公式同样能估算出DPS。</p><p><br>13. 技能描述中，<span><span>优先最低血/最高血都是少写了百分比。比如同样是只剩5000血，满血10000（50%）和满血15000（33.33%）的，优先最低血的技能会优先给到后者。</span></span></p><p><br></p><p>14. 如伊芙等部分天子，其ss效果包含两个部分，其一是攻击，其二是减益。攻击和减益的命中与否是分开判定的。</p><p><br></p><p>15. 以下buff是<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">加算</span>的，统称为额外增伤。X=我方的（<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">百分比</span>弱点伤害提升+<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">百分比</span>TS/SS/Skill强化<span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">Ⅱ+暴击伤害提升）+敌方的（弱点防御下降+</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important; font-weight: bold;\">百分比</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">TS/SS/Skill防御下降）。相对的，还有一些buff，如非弱点技能防御力提升、百分比TS/SS/Skill防御力提升，也都是与前述X加算，只是这些buff的数值是负的。注意，类似露娜ss的锐利之刃（依光属性队友数量提升弱点技能最终伤害），也是属于额外增伤，且根据buff叠加原则，可以和普通的百分比弱点最终伤害叠加。</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important; font-weight: bold;\">红暴提供的暴伤和红敏提供的弱点伤害同样属于额外增伤。</span></span></p><p><br></p><p>16. 弱点防御下降、Skill防御下降是防御力下降吗？不是。这两个都是额外增伤，见15条。防御力下降只有防御力下降和乱舞之刃，就是木伞ss的两个效果。</p><p><br></p><p>17.攻击/减益的先后顺序。举个例子，技能描述为优先最低血3体2连打，那么常常看到3个目标受伤是有先后顺序的。先后顺序的判定如下，依上述例子，当优先对象为最低血时，攻击的第1目标为百分比血量最低，第2目标为百分比血量<span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">第二低</span></span>，第3目标为百分比血量第三低。若技能为3体，而敌人只有2体，在确定完第1目标和第2目标后，此时没有剩下敌人，则进行第二轮判定，第3目标与第1目标将为同一个敌人。若技能优先对象为攻击型天子等无法量化的指标，则会在符合条件的目标内随机进行第1目标、第2目标、第3目标……的判定。减益同理。</p><p><br></p><p>18. 关于雅典娜的减益挑衅效果。减益挑衅无法将队友已有的debuff转移到自己身上，只能预防将来的debuff。举个例子，U排球妹的SS为3体水球+减速，当我方U雅典娜发动TS时，能够代替队友承受2个减益。如果雅典娜自身为排球妹3体的目标之一，实际效果为，只有雅典娜会挂上水球+减速，本质上雅典娜瞬间承受了3次水球+减速，但<span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">根据buff/debuff叠加原则，3次水球+减速被互相覆盖，就只剩下了1次。如果雅典娜自身不在排球妹3体的目标内，则会变成原本的第3目标和雅典娜挂上水球+减速。其余的debuff同理。</span></span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 42813, "username": "不再年轻了", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/1.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 26, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 18, "read_num": 378323, "like_num": 292}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/652839.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 3, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/36968.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 12, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/862842.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}], "reward": {"user_count": 0, "last_user_list": null}, "content_tj_eq": {"content_id": 0, "content": "", "version": ""}, "content_tj_lineup": {"content_id": 0, "content": "", "content_1": "", "version": ""}, "content_tj_eq_cdn": "", "content_tj_lineup_cdn": "", "content_live_2d": "", "hot_content_strategies": [{"id": 75195, "name": "练角推荐评分表格", "icon": "", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 588214, "name": "天命之子国际服天子修正前后对比图鉴（全）", "icon": "", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 591546, "name": "纠缠的薇薇安", "icon": "", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 58596, "name": "入坑攻略-从零开始的保姆向指南(下载\\选初始\\换绑定\\前期发展)", "icon": "", "jump_url": ""}], "related_strategies": [{"id": 53916, "name": "三服进度差", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1600029341325_57026366.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 73484, "name": "减益延长＆命中机制探寻", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1617458965305_54263474.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 22783, "name": "减益爆发", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1620630903312_36405431.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 63898, "name": "加速充能科普", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1608120417574_53624488.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 68552, "name": "Buff种类科普", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1612189522943_77566778.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 68352, "name": "SS冷却时间", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1611993068862_24600215.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 48899, "name": "百分比刀探讨", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1618732416585_49262101.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 75232, "name": "暴击科普", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1632033257354_78423814.png", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 70904, "name": "四星百分比刀应用", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1622871761123_73018282.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 52136, "name": "国际服TS、SS与FT伤害公式完善", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1598767039032_88879457.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 69146, "name": "强化Ⅰ/Ⅱ区别", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1612755022081_93262533.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "jump_url": ""}, {"id": 167496, "name": "游戏运行优化方法", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/107952/2023/6/10/81288.png", "jump_url": ""}], "entry_pid": 62014}, "meta": {"request_id": "request:4308777a-91b2-4e85-830b-17ab0f17e794", "trace_id": "trace:7ef2de95-058c-4462-9589-7b3ab5684169"}}